      "title": "Per run totals",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mph-prometheus"
      },
      "description": "One row per run id: final tokens, iterations, tool calls and context used, each read as its last value over the selected range. Format=Table on each target makes the Prometheus datasource turn the mph_run_id label into a real column; Merge then joins the four queries on run id and evaluation time, and Organize names the columns and drops the time column.",
